  "assumptions_and_limits": [
    "Compressed national capacities extrapolate one mixed-landscape Uppsala 2024 block; they are estimates, not a full-country conversion.",
    "Full intersecting blocks include coastal/foreign pixels. The coarse Swedish land polygon omits small islands. One incomplete 2024 row is excluded and recorded.",
    "Base resolution is bit-exact in all measured formats. The compact representation needs both COGs and float32(int8_values) * per_pixel_scale; no additional quantization is introduced.",
    "No-overview estimates exclude pyramids. Average embedding overviews are a storage measurement only and are not a validated substitute for full-resolution model input.",
    "Capacity excludes auxiliary source rasters, backups, replication, prepared inference caches and conversion scratch. Retaining source NPY adds its own listed capacity.",
    "Float32 capacity clipped exactly to the coarse Swedish land area would be 2.2472589603404173 TB/year before compression; full source blocks give approximately 2.57 TB/year."
  ],
